;    0: TWdLink(count=5966, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"It's gotten completely dark already... 
{PAUSE ""}
By the way, Senpai, where's <STYLE ID="1">your mom</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went out looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> again too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So before she went, I had her sneak me these."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\鍵束.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\サード\鍵束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">In my hand was the bunch of keys.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> weren't supposed to find out, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had picked them out for me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">If this leads to solving the curse-killings, I'll call it a necessary evil.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Is there only one storehouse key in there?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Probably. Why, what about it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was holed up in the storehouse with that key, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　So that means after <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> vanished, the key was found inside the storehouse?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Nobody told me, but given the situation, I guess so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Someone must've collected it from the storehouse. Something bugging you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Which means <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> disappeared without the key. 
{PAUSE ""}
If <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had left the storehouse on her own, she would have taken the key with her, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe she was just going to the bathroom or something without locking up?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　There doesn't seem to be a bathroom in the storehouse, and if she meant to come right back..."</STYLE><PG>
"Even so, <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> must have meant to come back to the storehouse. 
{PAUSE ""}
And yet she's not in the storehouse, which means she left it against her will. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, there's a good chance she was kidnapped."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You sure can figure out a lot from one key..."</STYLE><PG>
"It's still only a hypothesis, though... 
{PAUSE ""}
With this case, I can't even guess how far this kind of logic will hold..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's a case you can't solve from a common-sense point of view, after all..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">I stuck a random key into the keyhole.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I didn't know which key went where, but they were all old.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵をかける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, it's open. </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, get the light."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">I opened the door, and </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="4"> lit up the inside with her phone's flashlight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Dusty air came rushing out, and I turned my face away without thinking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Covering my mouth and nose with my cuff, I squinted inside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵１階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Nothing seems particularly out of place..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="2"> can tell that, when this is your first time seeing the place?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, I was just saying that."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I groped around for the light switch.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"This must be it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="4">With the lights on, the storehouse turned out to be strewn with nothing but what looked like junk.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7" RUBY="さ">Rusted</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> nata and maces, tattered Noh masks and other things unique to Arata, down to ordinary farm tools like hoes.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, is it okay to turn on the lights? People will find out we're here, won't they?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"We can just say we were a little curious about what's in the storehouse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's... right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Even if high-school girls sneak into a storehouse out of curiosity, the worst they'll get is a little scolding.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">If a little scolding is all it costs to search this place, it's no big deal.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, let's just take a quick look at everything for now. It's not that big a storehouse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Do you know the layout of this place?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No clue."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I'd known the storehouse was here, but this was my first time inside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">To start the search, I took one step farther in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The instant I did, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="4"> grabbed my sleeve tight.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, please don't leave my side..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You scared?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Of course I am...! <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> might have been kidnapped right here!?
{PAUSE ""}
　And if the culprit turned out to be <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Come to think of it, this place could be where she was kidnapped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had been reading those books, and I'd been so caught up in them that I'd forgotten what this place might be.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵階段明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"It's split into a second floor and a basement."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Which one should we pick? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The most suspicious one is... gotta be the basement."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">I headed for the stairs going down to the basement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="4"> squeezed my arm even tighter.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵地下扉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What's this supposed to be..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵地下扉番号.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"It's an electronic lock. This door alone is a lot newer. 
{PAUSE ""}
It can't have been installed more than 10 years ago."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So that means </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> know this room's secret. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Can't be helped. Let's go to the second floor."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You're right..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">The second floor didn't have as much junk as downstairs, but there were several dusty desks, with what looked like books piled messily on top.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had been doing her research up here, then?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"There are books here, but no bookshelves. The storehouse's books are probably in that room in the basement. 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\翠眼呪殺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
Look, this is the book on the Green-Eye Curse-Killing that <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> sent me photos of."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> brought books up from the basement and went through them in this open space."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Somewhere in these few dozen books, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> must have found the truth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">So which book did </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> look at?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, let's find whatever truth </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> found in here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Wait, that's dangerous. 
{PAUSE ""}
If <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> really did go missing because she learned the truth, then we're in danger right now too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hm? So that means... </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is watching us even now...?"</STYLE><PG>
"If it's an ordinary living thing, then yes, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
we don't know what form <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE> takes or how it's keeping watch on this settlement..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It makes </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hear voices even from far away, and makes cherry trees grow out of nowhere, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So that means </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can keep watch from anywhere in the world..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, that doesn't mean it's watching the two of us too.
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, have you ever heard <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE>'s voice?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You mean precognition? No way. Of course not..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Same here. 
{PAUSE ""}
The conditions for connecting with <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE> might be more limited than we think. 
{PAUSE ""}
If only people with precognition are watched by <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE>..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So you mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can't tell what the two of us are doing in real time...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"To be precise, I think it's through <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> that <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE> communicates. 
{PAUSE ""}
Leaving <STYLE ID="9">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> behind may have been the right call. 
{PAUSE ""}
