<STYLE ID="4">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">............</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The sound of writing went on for a while, and after the pen was set down, I heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> sigh.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\paper-round1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Then came the rustle of paper being handled, and the soft thumps of books being restacked.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">What was she doing...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"That sound is her hiding the memo."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hiding the memo?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE>―<STYLE ID="8">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> can apparently hijack <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> five senses, so she wrote the memo and hid it where <STYLE ID="3">her own</STYLE> eyes wouldn't fall on it. 
{PAUSE ""}
She probably put that phone somewhere hard to see too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see. So that's why the handwriting was so awful, and why the memo and the phone were so hard to find."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Who's there!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\録音.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Suddenly, from the phone, came </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> shout.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And the sound of a knife being drawn.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="4"> stopped what she was doing too, listening intently.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The air grew even more tense.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">And then, footsteps coming up the stairs―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> breathing could be heard right next to the phone, so they weren't </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> footsteps.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> wasn't the only one there. Someone else was coming up the stairs.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">That voice...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">It clearly wasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and it wasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Grandma's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Kana's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Who? Whose voice was it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">for some reason, it sounded like a voice I'd heard somewhere before.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mo... Mom...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> voice, calling someone "Mom."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> calls only one person in this world Mom―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">no, in the next world too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...! But how...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">I'm sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">Mom's finally made it back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Little by little, the tears crept into </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> voice.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Then came a small cry from </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and a sound like someone being struck.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And the sound of someone, presumably </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, falling to the floor.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">"Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">, let's carry her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="18">"Right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="18">, you take that side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Two sets of heavy footsteps slowly went down the stairs.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">What... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">What the hell is this...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and... </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Besides, they've both been dead for at least 10 years, right?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Something far beyond anything I could have imagined had happened here last night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The shock of it made me sink down onto the floor.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, are you okay!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="4"> crouched down too, bringing her eyes level with mine.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">like I could be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Why would </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, when they're dead..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, calm down. In these curse-killings, what common sense says cannot be is exactly what happens."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What is this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This is just too crazy... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Precognition and weird mushrooms are one thing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">but now dead bodies are moving around...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">At that moment, the Arata settlement's word 'shinigami' came back to me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">The shinigami that return to this world on the anniversary of a death and take away whoever they want to take.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Last night, that very thing had been reenacted, perfectly.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
